584e332007810716e08","start":146,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-52c101e4de3cc480cc79","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-55531cdb96f8079c0577","layer":"pei","quote":"时息从父仲台，现为凉州刺史；于是衡为诏，征仲台，遣归。遂诏中都官及郡部督邮：捕诸赵尺儿以上，及仲台皆杀之；有藏者，与同罪","attribution":"裴注·魏略《勇侠传》","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48d5c144befb35f43c2d","start":277,"end":337,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-5c345c7fe675399421a1","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-55531cdb96f8079c0577","layer":"pei","quote":"息自知前过，乃逃走","attribution":"裴注·魏略《勇侠传》","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48d5c144befb35f43c2d","start":267,"end":276,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-a050ada4893f3407a3de","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-55531cdb96f8079c0577","layer":"pei","quote":"后数岁，唐衡及弟皆死；岐乃得出，还本郡","attribution":"裴注·魏略《勇侠传》","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48d5c144befb35f43c2d","start":696,"end":715,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"lizang-q-da30d83214f4f574bdea","section":"chapter-018","block":"b-55531cdb96f8079c0577","layer":"pei","quote":"衡弟皆知之，甚恚，欲灭诸赵。因书与衡，求为京兆尹。旬月之间，得为之","attribution":"裴注·魏略《勇侠传》","section_title":"二李臧文吕许典二庞阎传第十八","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0041.xhtml","index":278,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-48d5c144befb35f43c2d","start":233,"end":266,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-e-p004a-q","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-52c69f6bca4740f3744f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《典略》曰：“中常侍唐衡，欲以女妻汝南傅公明；公明不娶，转以与彧。父绲慕衡势，为彧娶之。彧为论者所讥。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a2a81df5b8cc852cc823","start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p004","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-52c69f6bca4740f3744f","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞《典略》曰：“中常侍唐衡，欲以女妻汝南傅公明；公明不娶，转以与彧。父绲慕衡势，为彧娶之。彧为论者所讥。”","attribution":"《典略》","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":19,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a2a81df5b8cc852cc823","start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p005","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-804a2fb917c5799b1678","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：《汉纪》云“唐衡以桓帝延熹七年死”，计彧于时年始二岁；则彧婚之日，衡之没久矣。慕势之言为不然也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a2a81df5b8cc852cc823","start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p005-judgment","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-804a2fb917c5799b1678","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之按：《汉纪》云“唐衡以桓帝延熹七年死”，计彧于时年始二岁；则彧婚之日，衡之没久矣。慕势之言为不然也。","attribution":"裴松之按","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":20,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a2a81df5b8cc852cc823","start":0,"end":53,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p006","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-daab014fd82307701cd6","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之又以为：绲，“八龙”之一，必非苟得者也；将有逼而然，何云慕势哉？昔郑忽以违齐致讥，隽生以拒霍见美；致讥在于失援，见美嘉其虑远；并无交至之害，故得各全其志耳。至于阉竖用事，四海屏气；左悺、唐衡，杀生在口。故于时谚云“左回天，唐独坐”，言威权莫二也。顺之则六亲以安，忤违则大祸立至；斯诚以存易亡，蒙耻期全之日。昔蒋诩姻于王氏，无损清高之操；绲之此婚，庸何伤乎？","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a2a81df5b8cc852cc823","start":0,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xunyu-q-p006-judgment","section":"chapter-010","block":"b-daab014fd82307701cd6","layer":"pei","quote":"臣松之又以为：绲，“八龙”之一，必非苟得者也；将有逼而然，何云慕势哉？昔郑忽以违齐致讥，隽生以拒霍见美；致讥在于失援，见美嘉其虑远；并无交至之害，故得各全其志耳。至于阉竖用事，四海屏气；左悺、唐衡，杀生在口。故于时谚云“左回天，唐独坐”，言威权莫二也。顺之则六亲以安，忤违则大祸立至；斯诚以存易亡，蒙耻期全之日。昔蒋诩姻于王氏，无损清高之操；绲之此婚，庸何伤乎？","attribution":"裴松之论","section_title":"荀彧荀攸贾诩传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0025.xhtml","index":21,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-a2a81df5b8cc852cc823","start":0,"end":181,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
